/.poster-tmp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Held out of this PUBLIC repo on purpose. All of these exist locally and are
# unaffected — they are simply not published, because they document internal
# marketing strategy and the provenance/conditioning of the product imagery.
# Keep them with the project in private storage.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/BUILD_BRIEF.md
/FRAMES.md
/scripts/build-frames.cjs
/scripts/declutter.cjs

# Committed deliberately, listed here so the intent is on the record:
#   public/frames/**  (400 WebP, ~15 MB) — the hero mechanic does not work
#                     without them and Amplify builds straight from this repo
#   public/video/**   (4 MP4, ~53 MB)   — same
#   src/data/manifest.generated.ts      — regenerated by prebuild, committed so
#                     a fresh clone typechecks before any script has run
# Raw camera/render sources are NOT in this repo; see FRAMES.md.
